@startuml
title D2B — Surefyre Product Architecture
caption PNG-inspired layout with forced horizontal platform components

left to right direction

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam wrapWidth 220
skinparam maxMessageSize 120
skinparam nodesep 95
skinparam ranksep 100
skinparam padding 20

skinparam rectangle {
  RoundCorner 14
  BorderThickness 1.4
}
skinparam package {
  RoundCorner 16
  BorderThickness 1.8
}

rectangle "EXTERNAL USER\n\nRetail Agent\n\n• Submits new business\n• Uploads documents\n• Tracks status\n• Responds to requests\n• Receives quotes and decisions" as Agent #EAF2FF

package "SUREFYRE PLATFORM" as Surefyre #EAF4EA {
  together {
    rectangle "Agent Portal\n\n• Online submission\n• Document uploads\n• Validation\n• Message center\n• Status tracking" as Portal #F4FAF0

    rectangle "Rules and Workflow Engine\n\n• Validation and rules\n• Eligibility checks\n• Routing and queues\n• Task creation\n• Notifications" as Rules #F4FAF0

    rectangle "Underwriting Workbench\n\n• Review and analyze\n• Request information\n• Quote / refer / bind\n• Decisioning\n• Activity and notes" as Workbench #EAF2FF
  }

  Portal -right-> Rules : 1. Validate
  Rules -right-> Workbench : 2. Route

  ' Force PlantUML to preserve the left-to-right row.
  Portal -[hidden]right-> Rules
  Rules -[hidden]right-> Workbench
}

rectangle "AIM\n(Core System)\n\n• Policy administration\n• Transactions\n• Premium and billing\n• Accounts and producers" as AIM #FFF1DF
rectangle "ImageRight\n(Document System)\n\n• Document storage\n• Workflow\n• Audit trail\n• Correspondence" as ImageRight #FFF1DF
rectangle "Carrier / Rating /\nThird-Party Services\n\n• Rating\n• Policy services\n• Claims reference\n• Data enrichment" as External #FFF1DF

Agent -right-> Portal : New submission\nInformation and documents
Portal -[dashed]left-> Agent : Status, quote,\nrequests, decisions\nand documents

Workbench -right-> AIM : Transaction and\npolicy data
AIM -[dashed]left-> Workbench : Status and results

Workbench -right-> ImageRight : Document metadata\nand requests
ImageRight -[dashed]left-> Workbench : Document IDs\nand status

Workbench -right-> External : Rating, inquiry or\npolicy request
External -[dashed]left-> Workbench : Response,\ndecision or data

AIM -[hidden]down-> ImageRight
ImageRight -[hidden]down-> External

legend bottom
|= Flow |= Meaning |
| Solid arrow | Primary submission or request flow |
| Dashed arrow | Response flow back to the requester |
endlegend

note bottom of Surefyre
Simplified interview model.
Actual integrations and data flows may vary by SPG business unit,
insurance program and customer configuration.
end note

@enduml
